#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Recorders-to-Services Migration Guide"
msgstr "记录器到服务的迁移指南"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "This guide describes how to migrate Quarkus extensions from the legacy `@Record`/`@Recorder` pattern to the modern `ServiceRegistrar` service system."
msgstr "本指南介绍了如何将 Quarkus 扩展从传统的 `@Record/@Recorder` 模式迁移到现代的 `ServiceRegistrar` 服务系统。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "The `ServiceRegistrar` service system replaces `@Recorder` with a typed service model. Services declare dependencies explicitly and execute in dependency order, not build step order. The system is designed for incremental migration — converted and unconverted extensions may coexist."
msgstr "`ServiceRegistrar` 服务系统用一种类型化的服务模型取代了 `@Recorder` 。服务会显式声明依赖关系，并按依赖顺序执行，而非按构建步骤顺序执行。该系统专为增量迁移而设计——已转换和未转换的扩展可共存。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Architectural Differences"
msgstr "架构差异"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Explicit Dependencies Only"
msgstr "仅显式依赖项"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Services get **no** implicit ordering from the build step graph. All ordering comes from `require()`, `after()`, `before()`, or `afterBuildItem()`."
msgstr "服务 *不会* 从构建步骤图中获得隐式排序。所有排序均来自 `require()` 、 `after()` 、 `before()` 或 `afterBuildItem()` 。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Services are Independent from Recorders in the Same Step"
msgstr "同一步骤中的服务与记录器相互独立"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Even if a build step method contains both a `@Record` call and an `ServiceRegistrar` call, the service and recorder are separate nodes in the build execution plan with no implicit ordering between them."
msgstr "即使某个构建步骤方法中同时包含 `@Record` 调用和 `ServiceRegistrar` 调用，该服务和记录器在构建执行计划中也是独立的节点，两者之间不存在隐含的执行顺序。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Values Flow Through the Dependency Graph"
msgstr "值在依赖图中流转"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Service values are passed from producer to consumer via indexed dependency access on `ServiceNode`, not through the `StartupContext` maps (except when using recorder proxy bridges)."
msgstr "服务值是通过 `ServiceNode` 上的索引依赖访问从生产者传递给消费者的，而不是通过 `StartupContext` 映射（使用记录器代理桥接的情况除外）。"

