#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Common Conversion Pitfalls"
msgstr "常见的转换误区"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "ClassLoader &amp; Thread Context ClassLoader (TCCL)"
msgstr "类加载器与线程上下文类加载器（TCCL）"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Recorder bytecode always ran with the **runtime classloader as the TCCL**. Any recorder code that captured `Thread.currentThread().getContextClassLoader()` for later use relied on that.\n"
"* After converting, ensure that the service still runs with the runtime CL as TCCL, and that captured/inherited CLs are the runtime CL (not the system `AppClassLoader`).\n"
"* Clean up threads or `ThreadLocal`s your service owns in `onStop()`; never leak the `QuarkusClassLoader`."
msgstr "记录器的字节码始终使用 *运行时类加载器作为 TCCL* 运行。任何捕获 `Thread.currentThread().getContextClassLoader()` 以供后续使用的记录器代码都依赖于此。 * 转换后，请确保服务仍以运行时类加载器作为 TCCL 运行，并且捕获/继承的类加载器均为运行时类加载器（而非系统 `AppClassLoader` ）。 * `在 `onStop()` 中` 清理 `服务拥有的` 线程或 `ThreadLocal；` 切勿泄漏 `QuarkusClassLoader` 。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Concrete Class Proxying"
msgstr "具体类的代理"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "`staticInitServiceAsRecorderValue(ConcreteClass.class)` fails if the class has a non-trivial constructor. Use `staticInitServiceAsRuntimeValue()` instead — `RuntimeValue` is always proxyable."
msgstr "如果类具有非平凡构造函数，则 `staticInitServiceAsRecorderValue(ConcreteClass.class)` 会失败。请改用 `staticInitServiceAsRuntimeValue()` —— `RuntimeValue` 始终可被代理。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Package-Private Visibility"
msgstr "包私有可见性"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Lambda bytecode runs at runtime but references runtime classes directly. Package-private classes become inaccessible from the generated consolidated class. Ensure any classes referenced within the lambda are `public`."
msgstr "Lambda 字节码在运行时执行，但会直接引用运行时类。在生成的合并类中，无法访问包私有类。请确保 Lambda 内部引用的所有类均为 `public 类` 。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Never Reference Deployment Classes inside Service Lambdas"
msgstr "切勿在服务 Lambda 中引用部署类"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Always place helper methods, custom interfaces, or static factory methods inside your **runtime** module classes (which are present at runtime). Doing so inside your processor class compiles successfully but throws `NoClassDefFoundError` at runtime."
msgstr "请务必将辅助方法、自定义接口或静态工厂方法放置在 *运行时* 模块类（即运行时存在的类）中。如果将它们放在处理器类中，虽然编译会成功，但在运行时会抛出 `NoClassDefFoundError 异常` 。"
